---
description: Code comments — always English; explain intent, not the mechanics
alwaysApply: true
---

# Code comments

- Write every code comment in **English**: inline `//`, block `/* */`, JSDoc `/** */`, and comments inside tests, demos, and scripts.
- Put comments around intent, trade-offs, or non-obvious constraints. Skip comments that merely restate the code.
- Chinese belongs in user-facing copy (`locale` values, UI text), docs under `docs/`, and changelog — never in source comments.
